      "type": "text",
      "roundness": null,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Brokered calls are indistinguishable in the record: the same events,\nreceipts, taint folding, and per-call result budgeting apply whether the\ncall came from the model or from agent-written code in the sandbox.\n\nA capability reachable without this path is a complete bypass of every\ncontrol in the specification — so there is no such path.",
      "originalText": "Brokered calls are indistinguishable in the record: the same events,\nreceipts, taint folding, and per-call result budgeting apply whether the\ncall came from the model or from agent-written code in the sandbox.\n\nA capability reachable without this path is a complete bypass of every\ncontrol in the specification — so there is no such path.",
