      "type": "text",
      "roundness": null,
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Exactly two callers, indistinguishable downstream of step 1: the loop (a tool_use chunk) and the in-sandbox broker (agent-written code).\nThere is no third caller — a direct network path from sandbox code to a connector or MCP endpoint is a prohibited egress route, not a shortcut.\nA deny at any layer is final. Steps 6–7 never skip: a standing scope, batch, or plan pre-authorization may satisfy an ask — never suppress one.\nSkills sit below the table, not inside it: an activated skill intersects the resolved catalog and can only remove candidates, never add one.",
      "originalText": "Exactly two callers, indistinguishable downstream of step 1: the loop (a tool_use chunk) and the in-sandbox broker (agent-written code).\nThere is no third caller — a direct network path from sandbox code to a connector or MCP endpoint is a prohibited egress route, not a shortcut.\nA deny at any layer is final. Steps 6–7 never skip: a standing scope, batch, or plan pre-authorization may satisfy an ask — never suppress one.\nSkills sit below the table, not inside it: an activated skill intersects the resolved catalog and can only remove candidates, never add one.",
